globalThis.EluceniaToolLocales={"id":"criterios-de-framingham-ic","clinicalApproval":"not-performed","professionalLanguageApproval":"not-performed","locales":{"pt-BR":{"tool":{"id":"criterios-de-framingham-ic","title":"Critérios de Framingham para insuficiência cardíaca","summary":"Diagnóstico clínico de IC por critérios maiores e menores","lead":"Critérios clínicos clássicos do estudo de Framingham para diagnosticar insuficiência cardíaca congestiva à beira do leito.","fields":[["dpn","Maior: dispneia paroxística noturna ou ortopneia","chk",{}],["turgencia","Maior: turgência jugular","chk",{}],["estertores","Maior: estertores pulmonares","chk",{}],["cardiomegalia","Maior: cardiomegalia na radiografia","chk",{}],["eap","Maior: edema agudo de pulmão","chk",{}],["b3","Maior: terceira bulha (galope)","chk",{}],["pvc","Maior: pressão venosa central &gt; 16 cmH₂O","chk",{}],["tc","Maior: tempo de circulação ≥ 25 s","chk",{}],["refluxo","Maior: refluxo hepatojugular","chk",{}],["perda","Maior ou menor: perda ≥ 4,5 kg em 5 dias com o tratamento","chk",{}],["edema","Menor: edema bilateral de tornozelos","chk",{}],["tosse","Menor: tosse noturna","chk",{}],["dispneia","Menor: dispneia aos esforços habituais","chk",{}],["hepatomegalia","Menor: hepatomegalia","chk",{}],["derrame","Menor: derrame pleural","chk",{}],["cv","Menor: capacidade vital reduzida em 1/3 do máximo","chk",{}],["taqui","Menor: taquicardia (FC ≥ 120 bpm)","chk",{}]],"formula":"<p>Diagnóstico de insuficiência cardíaca com <strong>2 critérios maiores</strong> ou <strong>1 maior + 2 menores</strong>.</p><p>Os critérios menores só contam se não puderem ser atribuídos a outra condição (por exemplo, hipertensão pulmonar, DPOC, cirrose, ascite ou síndrome nefrótica). A perda de peso com o tratamento pode contar como critério maior ou menor; aqui é contada como maior.</p>","sources":[["McKee PA et al. The natural history of congestive heart failure: the Framingham study. N Engl J Med, 1971.","https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJM197112232852601"],["McDonagh TA et al. 2021 ESC Guidelines for the diagnosis and treatment of acute and chronic heart failure. Eur Heart J, 2021.","https://doi.org/10.1093/eurheartj/ehab368"],["Framingham official event protocol,Version2,2006-08-24","https://biolincc.nhlbi.nih.gov/media/studies/framcohort/Protocols/Criteria%20for%20Events%20-%20Sequence%20of%20Events%20File%20SOE.pdf"],["ARIC heart-failure abstraction protocol","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/document.cgi?phd=4516&study_id=phs000280.v3.p1"]],"methodVersion":"Framingham/Mc Kee 1971:2 maiores ou 1 maior+2 menores; perda depeso contada maior","limits":"Os critérios maiores e menores devem estar presentes simultaneamente; causas alternativas dos sinais precisam ser consideradas. Esta interface usa a perda de pelo menos 4,5 kg em 5 dias durante tratamento como critério maior; não aplique esse peso a perda sem esse contexto. O conjunto histórico não estabelece todos os fenótipos atuais de insuficiência cardíaca nem substitui avaliação estrutural e funcional. O protocolo Framingham de 2006 contém itens adicionais e não deve ser apresentado como se cada um estivesse implementado nesta versão histórica.","limitsLocale":"pt-BR","resultLabels":{"Critérios de Framingham para insuficiência cardíaca":"Critérios de Framingham para insuficiência cardíaca"},"resultUnits":{},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Selecione","yes":"Sim","no":"Não","optional":"opcional","numeric":"Valor numérico","range":"intervalo","calculate":"Calcular","calculating":"Calculando…","clear":"Limpar","heading":"Calcular com transparência","intro":"Confira população, unidades e versão. O resultado apresenta a fórmula ou classificação, sem decisão terapêutica automática.","restricted":"Ficha disponível para consulta","restrictedNote":"Cálculo suspenso nesta edição. O inventário, a pendência e as fontes permanecem públicos.","resultNote":"Resultado da fórmula ou classificação. Interpretação, conduta e aplicabilidade dependem da avaliação profissional e da fonte selecionada.","invalid":"Não foi possível calcular com esses valores. Confira as condições de uso.","unavailable":"O serviço de cálculo está indisponível. Tente novamente.","connection":"Não foi possível consultar o serviço de cálculo. Verifique a conexão e tente novamente.","check":"Confira os valores informados.","fleischner":"Antes de calcular: referência para nódulos pulmonares incidentais. As recomendações não se aplicam a pessoas com menos de 35 anos, rastreamento de câncer de pulmão, imunossupressão ou câncer primário conhecido.","incompleteAssessment":"Sem avaliação completa, não é possível calcular a pontuação total."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · código de integração","clinical":"Revisão clínica independente não realizada.","conditions":"condições, fontes e permissões","record":"Ficha e referências","code":"Código JavaScript","cases":"Casos de referência","language":"Idioma","formula":"Fórmula documentada","edition":"Edição do método","limits":"Limites e população","references":"Referências"}},"en":{"tool":{"id":"criterios-de-framingham-ic","title":"Framingham heart failure criteria","titleLocale":"en","summary":"Clinical heart failure diagnosis with major and minor criteria","lead":"Classic Framingham study clinical criteria for bedside diagnosis of congestive heart failure.","fields":[["dpn","Major: paroxysmal nocturnal dyspnea or orthopnea","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["turgencia","Major: jugular venous distension","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["estertores","Major: pulmonary crackles","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["cardiomegalia","Major: cardiomegaly on chest radiograph","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["eap","Major: acute pulmonary edema","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["b3","Major: third heart sound (gallop)","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["pvc","Major: central venous pressure &gt; 16 cmH₂O","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["tc","Major: circulation time ≥ 25 s","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["refluxo","Major: hepatojugular reflux","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["perda","Major or minor: weight loss ≥ 4.5 kg in 5 days with treatment","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["edema","Minor: bilateral ankle edema","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["tosse","Minor: nocturnal cough","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["dispneia","Minor: dyspnea on ordinary exertion","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["hepatomegalia","Minor: hepatomegaly","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["derrame","Minor: pleural effusion","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["cv","Minor: vital capacity reduced by 1/3 of maximum","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["taqui","Minor: tachycardia (heart rate ≥ 120 bpm)","chk",{"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}]],"formula":"<p>Heart failure diagnosis with <strong>2 major criteria</strong> or <strong>1 major + 2 minor</strong>.</p><p>Minor criteria count only if not attributable to another condition (e.g. pulmonary hypertension, COPD, cirrhosis, ascites or nephrotic syndrome). Weight loss with treatment may count as major or minor; here it counts as major.</p>","sources":[["McKee PA et al. The natural history of congestive heart failure: the Framingham study. N Engl J Med, 1971.","https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJM197112232852601"],["McDonagh TA et al. 2021 ESC Guidelines for the diagnosis and treatment of acute and chronic heart failure. Eur Heart J, 2021.","https://doi.org/10.1093/eurheartj/ehab368"],["Framingham official event protocol,Version2,2006-08-24","https://biolincc.nhlbi.nih.gov/media/studies/framcohort/Protocols/Criteria%20for%20Events%20-%20Sequence%20of%20Events%20File%20SOE.pdf"],["ARIC heart-failure abstraction protocol","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/document.cgi?phd=4516&study_id=phs000280.v3.p1"]],"methodVersion":"Framingham/McKee 1971: 2 major or 1 major+2 minor; weight loss counted as major","methodVersionLocale":"en","limits":"The major and minor criteria must be present simultaneously; alternative causes of the signs must be considered. This interface treats a loss of at least 4.5 kg in 5 days during treatment as a major criterion; do not assign this scoring weight to weight loss outside that context. The historical set does not establish every current heart-failure phenotype or replace structural and functional assessment. The 2006 Framingham protocol contains additional items and must not be presented as though each of them were implemented in this historical version.","limitsLocale":"en","resultLabels":{"Critérios de Framingham":"Framingham criteria","Critérios de Framingham para insuficiência cardíaca":"Framingham heart failure criteria"},"resultUnits":{"maiores + menores":"major + minor"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Select","yes":"Yes","no":"No","optional":"optional","numeric":"Numeric value","range":"range","calculate":"Calculate","calculating":"Calculating…","clear":"Clear","heading":"Calculate with transparency","intro":"Check the population, units and version. The result shows the formula or classification; it does not make an automatic treatment decision.","restricted":"Record available for reference","restrictedNote":"Calculation is suspended in this release. The inventory, outstanding review and sources remain public.","resultNote":"Formula or classification result. Interpretation, care and applicability depend on professional assessment and the selected source.","invalid":"Unable to calculate with these values. Check the conditions of use.","unavailable":"The calculation service is unavailable. Try again.","connection":"Unable to reach the calculation service. Check your connection and try again.","check":"Check the values entered.","fleischner":"Before calculating: reference for incidental pulmonary nodules. The recommendations do not apply to people under 35, lung cancer screening, immunosuppression or known primary cancer.","incompleteAssessment":"A total score cannot be calculated without a complete assessment."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · integration code","clinical":"Independent clinical review has not been performed.","conditions":"conditions, sources and permissions","record":"Record and references","code":"JavaScript code","cases":"Reference cases","language":"Language","formula":"Documented formula","edition":"Method edition","limits":"Limits and population","references":"References"}},"es":{"tool":{"id":"criterios-de-framingham-ic","title":"Criterios de Framingham para insuficiencia cardíaca","titleLocale":"es","summary":"Diagnóstico clínico de insuficiencia cardíaca por criterios mayores y menores","lead":"Criterios clínicos clásicos de Framingham para diagnosticar insuficiencia cardíaca congestiva a pie de cama.","fields":[["dpn","Mayor: disnea paroxística nocturna u ortopnea","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["turgencia","Mayor: ingurgitación yugular","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["estertores","Mayor: estertores pulmonares","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["cardiomegalia","Mayor: cardiomegalia en la radiografía","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["eap","Mayor: edema agudo de pulmón","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["b3","Mayor: tercer ruido cardíaco (galope)","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["pvc","Mayor: presión venosa central &gt; 16 cmH₂O","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["tc","Mayor: tiempo de circulación ≥ 25 s","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["refluxo","Mayor: reflujo hepatoyugular","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["perda","Mayor o menor: pérdida ≥ 4,5 kg en 5 días con tratamiento","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["edema","Menor: edema bilateral de tobillos","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["tosse","Menor: tos nocturna","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["dispneia","Menor: disnea con esfuerzos habituales","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["hepatomegalia","Menor: hepatomegalia","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["derrame","Menor: derrame pleural","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["cv","Menor: capacidad vital reducida en 1/3 del máximo","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["taqui","Menor: taquicardia (frecuencia cardíaca ≥ 120 bpm)","chk",{"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}]],"formula":"<p>Diagnóstico de insuficiencia cardíaca con <strong>2 criterios mayores</strong> o <strong>1 mayor + 2 menores</strong>.</p><p>Los menores solo cuentan si no se atribuyen a otra condición (hipertensión pulmonar, EPOC, cirrosis, ascitis o síndrome nefrótico). La pérdida de peso con tratamiento puede ser mayor o menor; aquí es mayor.</p>","sources":[["McKee PA et al. The natural history of congestive heart failure: the Framingham study. N Engl J Med, 1971.","https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJM197112232852601"],["McDonagh TA et al. 2021 ESC Guidelines for the diagnosis and treatment of acute and chronic heart failure. Eur Heart J, 2021.","https://doi.org/10.1093/eurheartj/ehab368"],["Framingham official event protocol,Version2,2006-08-24","https://biolincc.nhlbi.nih.gov/media/studies/framcohort/Protocols/Criteria%20for%20Events%20-%20Sequence%20of%20Events%20File%20SOE.pdf"],["ARIC heart-failure abstraction protocol","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/document.cgi?phd=4516&study_id=phs000280.v3.p1"]],"methodVersion":"Framingham/McKee 1971: 2 mayores o 1 mayor+2 menores; pérdida de peso contada como mayor","methodVersionLocale":"es","limits":"Los criterios mayores y menores deben estar presentes simultáneamente; deben considerarse causas alternativas de los signos. Esta interfaz utiliza la pérdida de al menos 4,5 kg en 5 días durante el tratamiento como criterio mayor; no atribuya esta ponderación a una pérdida sin ese contexto. El conjunto histórico no establece todos los fenotipos actuales de insuficiencia cardíaca ni sustituye la evaluación estructural y funcional. El protocolo Framingham de 2006 contiene elementos adicionales y no debe presentarse como si cada uno estuviera implementado en esta versión histórica.","limitsLocale":"es","resultLabels":{"Critérios de Framingham":"Criterios de Framingham","Critérios de Framingham para insuficiência cardíaca":"Criterios de Framingham para insuficiencia cardíaca"},"resultUnits":{"maiores + menores":"mayores + menores"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Seleccione","yes":"Sí","no":"No","optional":"opcional","numeric":"Valor numérico","range":"intervalo","calculate":"Calcular","calculating":"Calculando…","clear":"Limpiar","heading":"Calcular con transparencia","intro":"Compruebe la población, las unidades y la versión. El resultado presenta la fórmula o clasificación, sin decisión terapéutica automática.","restricted":"Ficha disponible para consulta","restrictedNote":"Cálculo suspendido en esta edición. El inventario, la revisión pendiente y las fuentes siguen siendo públicos.","resultNote":"Resultado de la fórmula o clasificación. La interpretación, la conducta y la aplicabilidad dependen de la evaluación profesional y de la fuente seleccionada.","invalid":"No se puede calcular con estos valores. Compruebe las condiciones de uso.","unavailable":"El servicio de cálculo no está disponible. Inténtelo de nuevo.","connection":"No se pudo consultar el servicio de cálculo. Compruebe la conexión e inténtelo de nuevo.","check":"Compruebe los valores introducidos.","fleischner":"Antes de calcular: referencia para nódulos pulmonares incidentales. Las recomendaciones no se aplican a menores de 35 años, cribado de cáncer de pulmón, inmunosupresión o cáncer primario conocido.","incompleteAssessment":"No se puede calcular el total sin una evaluación completa."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · código de integración","clinical":"No se ha realizado una revisión clínica independiente.","conditions":"condiciones, fuentes y permisos","record":"Ficha y referencias","code":"Código JavaScript","cases":"Casos de referencia","language":"Idioma","formula":"Fórmula documentada","edition":"Edición del método","limits":"Límites y población","references":"Referencias"}},"fr":{"tool":{"id":"criterios-de-framingham-ic","title":"Critères de Framingham d’insuffisance cardiaque","titleLocale":"fr","summary":"Diagnostic clinique d’insuffisance cardiaque par critères majeurs et mineurs","lead":"Critères cliniques classiques de Framingham pour diagnostiquer l’insuffisance cardiaque congestive au lit du malade.","fields":[["dpn","Majeur : dyspnée paroxystique nocturne ou orthopnée","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["turgencia","Majeur : turgescence jugulaire","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["estertores","Majeur : crépitants pulmonaires","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["cardiomegalia","Majeur : cardiomégalie à la radiographie","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["eap","Majeur : œdème aigu du poumon","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["b3","Majeur : troisième bruit cardiaque (galop)","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["pvc","Majeur : pression veineuse centrale &gt; 16 cmH₂O","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["tc","Majeur : temps de circulation ≥ 25 s","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["refluxo","Majeur : reflux hépatojugulaire","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["perda","Majeur ou mineur : perte ≥ 4,5 kg en 5 jours sous traitement","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["edema","Mineur : œdème bilatéral des chevilles","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["tosse","Mineur : toux nocturne","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["dispneia","Mineur : dyspnée lors des efforts habituels","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["hepatomegalia","Mineur : hépatomégalie","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["derrame","Mineur : épanchement pleural","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["cv","Mineur : capacité vitale réduite de 1/3 du maximum","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["taqui","Mineur : tachycardie (fréquence cardiaque ≥ 120 bpm)","chk",{"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}]],"formula":"<p>Diagnostic d’insuffisance cardiaque avec <strong>2 critères majeurs</strong> ou <strong>1 majeur + 2 mineurs</strong>.</p><p>Les critères mineurs comptent uniquement sans autre cause (hypertension pulmonaire, BPCO, cirrhose, ascite, syndrome néphrotique). La perte de poids sous traitement peut être majeure ou mineure ; ici elle est majeure.</p>","sources":[["McKee PA et al. The natural history of congestive heart failure: the Framingham study. N Engl J Med, 1971.","https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJM197112232852601"],["McDonagh TA et al. 2021 ESC Guidelines for the diagnosis and treatment of acute and chronic heart failure. Eur Heart J, 2021.","https://doi.org/10.1093/eurheartj/ehab368"],["Framingham official event protocol,Version2,2006-08-24","https://biolincc.nhlbi.nih.gov/media/studies/framcohort/Protocols/Criteria%20for%20Events%20-%20Sequence%20of%20Events%20File%20SOE.pdf"],["ARIC heart-failure abstraction protocol","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/document.cgi?phd=4516&study_id=phs000280.v3.p1"]],"methodVersion":"Framingham/McKee 1971 : 2 majeurs ou 1 majeur+2 mineurs ; perte de poids comptée comme majeure","methodVersionLocale":"fr","limits":"Les critères majeurs et mineurs doivent être présents simultanément ; les autres causes possibles des signes doivent être prises en compte. Cette interface utilise la perte d’au moins 4,5 kg en 5 jours pendant le traitement comme critère majeur ; n’attribuez pas cette pondération à une perte de poids hors de ce contexte. L’ensemble historique n’établit pas tous les phénotypes actuels d’insuffisance cardiaque et ne remplace pas l’évaluation structurelle et fonctionnelle. Le protocole Framingham de 2006 contient des éléments supplémentaires et ne doit pas être présenté comme si chacun était implémenté dans cette version historique.","limitsLocale":"fr","resultLabels":{"Critérios de Framingham":"Critères de Framingham","Critérios de Framingham para insuficiência cardíaca":"Critères de Framingham d’insuffisance cardiaque"},"resultUnits":{"maiores + menores":"majeurs + mineurs"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Sélectionner","yes":"Oui","no":"Non","optional":"facultatif","numeric":"Valeur numérique","range":"intervalle","calculate":"Calculer","calculating":"Calcul en cours…","clear":"Effacer","heading":"Calculer en toute transparence","intro":"Vérifiez la population, les unités et la version. Le résultat présente la formule ou la classification, sans décision thérapeutique automatique.","restricted":"Fiche disponible à la consultation","restrictedNote":"Calcul suspendu dans cette version. L’inventaire, la révision en attente et les sources restent publics.","resultNote":"Résultat de la formule ou de la classification. L’interprétation, la conduite et l’applicabilité dépendent de l’évaluation professionnelle et de la source sélectionnée.","invalid":"Calcul impossible avec ces valeurs. Vérifiez les conditions d’utilisation.","unavailable":"Le service de calcul est indisponible. Réessayez.","connection":"Impossible de joindre le service de calcul. Vérifiez la connexion et réessayez.","check":"Vérifiez les valeurs saisies.","fleischner":"Avant le calcul : référence pour les nodules pulmonaires fortuits. Les recommandations ne s’appliquent pas aux personnes de moins de 35 ans, au dépistage du cancer du poumon, à l’immunosuppression ou à un cancer primitif connu.","incompleteAssessment":"Le total ne peut pas être calculé sans évaluation complète."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · code d’intégration","clinical":"Aucune révision clinique indépendante n’a été effectuée.","conditions":"conditions, sources et autorisations","record":"Fiche et références","code":"Code JavaScript","cases":"Cas de référence","language":"Langue","formula":"Formule documentée","edition":"Édition de la méthode","limits":"Limites et population","references":"Références"}},"de":{"tool":{"id":"criterios-de-framingham-ic","title":"Framingham-Kriterien für Herzinsuffizienz","titleLocale":"de","summary":"Klinische Herzinsuffizienzdiagnose mit Haupt- und Nebenkriterien","lead":"Klassische klinische Framingham-Kriterien zur Diagnose kongestiver Herzinsuffizienz am Krankenbett.","fields":[["dpn","Hauptkriterium: paroxysmale nächtliche Dyspnoe oder Orthopnoe","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["turgencia","Hauptkriterium: Halsvenenstauung","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["estertores","Hauptkriterium: pulmonale Rasselgeräusche","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["cardiomegalia","Hauptkriterium: Kardiomegalie im Röntgenbild","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["eap","Hauptkriterium: akutes Lungenödem","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["b3","Hauptkriterium: dritter Herzton (Galopprhythmus)","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["pvc","Hauptkriterium: zentraler Venendruck &gt; 16 cmH₂O","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["tc","Hauptkriterium: Kreislaufzeit ≥ 25 s","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["refluxo","Hauptkriterium: hepatojugulärer Reflux","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["perda","Haupt- oder Nebenkriterium: Gewichtsverlust ≥ 4,5 kg in 5 Tagen unter Behandlung","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["edema","Nebenkriterium: beidseitige Knöchelödeme","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["tosse","Nebenkriterium: nächtlicher Husten","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["dispneia","Nebenkriterium: Dyspnoe bei gewöhnlicher Belastung","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["hepatomegalia","Nebenkriterium: Hepatomegalie","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["derrame","Nebenkriterium: Pleuraerguss","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["cv","Nebenkriterium: Vitalkapazität um 1/3 des Maximums vermindert","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["taqui","Nebenkriterium: Tachykardie (Herzfrequenz ≥ 120 bpm)","chk",{"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}]],"formula":"<p>Herzinsuffizienzdiagnose mit <strong>2 Hauptkriterien</strong> oder <strong>1 Haupt- + 2 Nebenkriterien</strong>.</p><p>Nebenkriterien zählen nur ohne andere Erklärung (pulmonale Hypertonie, COPD, Zirrhose, Aszites, nephrotisches Syndrom). Gewichtsverlust unter Behandlung kann Haupt- oder Nebenkriterium sein; hier Hauptkriterium.</p>","sources":[["McKee PA et al. The natural history of congestive heart failure: the Framingham study. N Engl J Med, 1971.","https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJM197112232852601"],["McDonagh TA et al. 2021 ESC Guidelines for the diagnosis and treatment of acute and chronic heart failure. Eur Heart J, 2021.","https://doi.org/10.1093/eurheartj/ehab368"],["Framingham official event protocol,Version2,2006-08-24","https://biolincc.nhlbi.nih.gov/media/studies/framcohort/Protocols/Criteria%20for%20Events%20-%20Sequence%20of%20Events%20File%20SOE.pdf"],["ARIC heart-failure abstraction protocol","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/document.cgi?phd=4516&study_id=phs000280.v3.p1"]],"methodVersion":"Framingham/McKee 1971: 2 Haupt- oder 1 Haupt-+2 Nebenkriterien; Gewichtsverlust als Hauptkriterium","methodVersionLocale":"de","limits":"Die Haupt- und Nebenkriterien müssen gleichzeitig vorliegen; alternative Ursachen der Zeichen müssen berücksichtigt werden. Diese Oberfläche verwendet einen Gewichtsverlust von mindestens 4,5 kg in 5 Tagen während der Behandlung als Hauptkriterium; wenden Sie diese Gewichtung nicht auf Gewichtsverlust außerhalb dieses Zusammenhangs an. Der historische Kriterienkatalog erfasst nicht alle heutigen Herzinsuffizienz-Phänotypen und ersetzt keine strukturelle und funktionelle Beurteilung. Das Framingham-Protokoll von 2006 enthält zusätzliche Kriterien und darf nicht so dargestellt werden, als sei jedes davon in dieser historischen Version implementiert.","limitsLocale":"de","resultLabels":{"Critérios de Framingham":"Framingham-Kriterien","Critérios de Framingham para insuficiência cardíaca":"Framingham-Kriterien für Herzinsuffizienz"},"resultUnits":{"maiores + menores":"Haupt- + Nebenkriterien"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Auswählen","yes":"Ja","no":"Nein","optional":"optional","numeric":"Numerischer Wert","range":"Bereich","calculate":"Berechnen","calculating":"Berechnung läuft…","clear":"Löschen","heading":"Transparent berechnen","intro":"Prüfen Sie Population, Einheiten und Version. Das Ergebnis zeigt die Formel oder Klassifikation, ohne automatisch eine Therapieentscheidung zu treffen.","restricted":"Eintrag zur Einsicht verfügbar","restrictedNote":"Die Berechnung ist in dieser Version ausgesetzt. Inventar, ausstehende Prüfung und Quellen bleiben öffentlich.","resultNote":"Ergebnis der Formel oder Klassifikation. Interpretation, Vorgehen und Anwendbarkeit hängen von der fachlichen Beurteilung und der ausgewählten Quelle ab.","invalid":"Berechnung mit diesen Werten nicht möglich. Prüfen Sie die Nutzungsbedingungen.","unavailable":"Der Berechnungsdienst ist nicht verfügbar. Versuchen Sie es erneut.","connection":"Der Berechnungsdienst ist nicht erreichbar. Prüfen Sie die Verbindung und versuchen Sie es erneut.","check":"Prüfen Sie die eingegebenen Werte.","fleischner":"Vor der Berechnung: Referenz für zufällig entdeckte Lungenrundherde. Die Empfehlungen gelten nicht für Personen unter 35 Jahren, Lungenkrebs-Screening, Immunsuppression oder bekannten Primärkrebs.","incompleteAssessment":"Ohne vollständige Untersuchung lässt sich kein Gesamtscore berechnen."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · Integrationscode","clinical":"Eine unabhängige klinische Prüfung wurde nicht durchgeführt.","conditions":"Bedingungen, Quellen und Berechtigungen","record":"Eintrag und Referenzen","code":"JavaScript-Code","cases":"Referenzfälle","language":"Sprache","formula":"Dokumentierte Formel","edition":"Fassung der Methode","limits":"Grenzen und Population","references":"Referenzen"}},"it":{"tool":{"id":"criterios-de-framingham-ic","title":"Criteri di Framingham per l’insufficienza cardiaca","titleLocale":"it","summary":"Diagnosi clinica di scompenso cardiaco con criteri maggiori e minori","lead":"Criteri clinici classici di Framingham per diagnosticare lo scompenso cardiaco congestizio al letto del paziente.","fields":[["dpn","Maggiore: dispnea parossistica notturna od ortopnea","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["turgencia","Maggiore: turgore giugulare","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["estertores","Maggiore: rantoli polmonari","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["cardiomegalia","Maggiore: cardiomegalia alla radiografia","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["eap","Maggiore: edema polmonare acuto","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["b3","Maggiore: terzo tono cardiaco (galoppo)","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["pvc","Maggiore: pressione venosa centrale &gt; 16 cmH₂O","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["tc","Maggiore: tempo di circolazione ≥ 25 s","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["refluxo","Maggiore: reflusso epato-giugulare","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["perda","Maggiore o minore: perdita ≥ 4,5 kg in 5 giorni con il trattamento","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["edema","Minore: edema bilaterale delle caviglie","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["tosse","Minore: tosse notturna","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["dispneia","Minore: dispnea durante gli sforzi abituali","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["hepatomegalia","Minore: epatomegalia","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["derrame","Minore: versamento pleurico","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["cv","Minore: capacità vitale ridotta di 1/3 del massimo","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["taqui","Minore: tachicardia (frequenza cardiaca ≥ 120 bpm)","chk",{"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}]],"formula":"<p>Diagnosi di scompenso cardiaco con <strong>2 criteri maggiori</strong> o <strong>1 maggiore + 2 minori</strong>.</p><p>I minori contano solo se non attribuibili ad altra causa (ipertensione polmonare, BPCO, cirrosi, ascite, sindrome nefrosica). La perdita di peso con terapia può essere maggiore o minore; qui è maggiore.</p>","sources":[["McKee PA et al. The natural history of congestive heart failure: the Framingham study. N Engl J Med, 1971.","https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJM197112232852601"],["McDonagh TA et al. 2021 ESC Guidelines for the diagnosis and treatment of acute and chronic heart failure. Eur Heart J, 2021.","https://doi.org/10.1093/eurheartj/ehab368"],["Framingham official event protocol,Version2,2006-08-24","https://biolincc.nhlbi.nih.gov/media/studies/framcohort/Protocols/Criteria%20for%20Events%20-%20Sequence%20of%20Events%20File%20SOE.pdf"],["ARIC heart-failure abstraction protocol","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/document.cgi?phd=4516&study_id=phs000280.v3.p1"]],"methodVersion":"Framingham/McKee 1971: 2 maggiori o 1 maggiore+2 minori; perdita di peso come maggiore","methodVersionLocale":"it","limits":"I criteri maggiori e minori devono essere presenti contemporaneamente; occorre considerare cause alternative dei segni. Questa interfaccia utilizza la perdita di almeno 4,5 kg in 5 giorni durante il trattamento come criterio maggiore; non attribuire questa ponderazione a una perdita di peso al di fuori di tale contesto. L’insieme storico non definisce tutti i fenotipi attuali di insufficienza cardiaca né sostituisce la valutazione strutturale e funzionale. Il protocollo Framingham del 2006 contiene elementi aggiuntivi e non deve essere presentato come se ciascuno fosse implementato in questa versione storica.","limitsLocale":"it","resultLabels":{"Critérios de Framingham":"Criteri di Framingham","Critérios de Framingham para insuficiência cardíaca":"Criteri di Framingham per l’insufficienza cardiaca"},"resultUnits":{"maiores + menores":"maggiori + minori"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Seleziona","yes":"Sì","no":"No","optional":"facoltativo","numeric":"Valore numerico","range":"intervallo","calculate":"Calcola","calculating":"Calcolo in corso…","clear":"Cancella","heading":"Calcolare con trasparenza","intro":"Verifica popolazione, unità e versione. Il risultato mostra la formula o la classificazione, senza una decisione terapeutica automatica.","restricted":"Scheda disponibile per consultazione","restrictedNote":"Calcolo sospeso in questa versione. Inventario, revisione in sospeso e fonti rimangono pubblici.","resultNote":"Risultato della formula o classificazione. Interpretazione, condotta e applicabilità dipendono dalla valutazione professionale e dalla fonte selezionata.","invalid":"Impossibile calcolare con questi valori. Verifica le condizioni d’uso.","unavailable":"Il servizio di calcolo non è disponibile. Riprova.","connection":"Impossibile contattare il servizio di calcolo. Verifica la connessione e riprova.","check":"Verifica i valori inseriti.","fleischner":"Prima del calcolo: riferimento per noduli polmonari incidentali. Le raccomandazioni non si applicano a persone di età inferiore a 35 anni, screening del cancro del polmone, immunosoppressione o tumore primario noto.","incompleteAssessment":"Il totale non può essere calcolato senza una valutazione completa."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · codice di integrazione","clinical":"Non è stata effettuata una revisione clinica indipendente.","conditions":"condizioni, fonti e autorizzazioni","record":"Scheda e riferimenti","code":"Codice JavaScript","cases":"Casi di riferimento","language":"Lingua","formula":"Formula documentata","edition":"Edizione del metodo","limits":"Limiti e popolazione","references":"Riferimenti"}},"ar":{"tool":{"id":"criterios-de-framingham-ic","title":"معايير Framingham لفشل القلب","titleLocale":"ar","summary":"تشخيص قصور القلب سريريًا بالمعايير الكبرى والصغرى","lead":"المعايير السريرية الكلاسيكية لدراسة فرامنغهام لتشخيص قصور القلب الاحتقاني عند سرير المريض.","fields":[["dpn","معيار رئيسي: ضيق النفس الليلي الانتيابي أو ضيق النفس عند الاستلقاء","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["turgencia","معيار رئيسي: احتقان أوردة الرقبة","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["estertores","معيار رئيسي: خراخر رئوية","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["cardiomegalia","معيار رئيسي: تضخم القلب في الأشعة","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["eap","معيار رئيسي: وذمة رئوية حادة","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["b3","معيار رئيسي: الصوت القلبي الثالث (إيقاع الخبب)","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["pvc","معيار رئيسي: الضغط الوريدي المركزي > ١٦ cmH₂O","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["tc","معيار رئيسي: زمن الدوران ≥ ٢٥ s","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["refluxo","معيار رئيسي: ارتجاع كبدي وداجي","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["perda","معيار رئيسي أو ثانوي: فقدان ≥ ٤٫٥ kg خلال ٥ أيام مع العلاج","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["edema","معيار ثانوي: وذمة الكاحلين","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["tosse","معيار ثانوي: سعال ليلي","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["dispneia","معيار ثانوي: ضيق النفس مع الجهد المعتاد","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["hepatomegalia","معيار ثانوي: تضخم الكبد","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["derrame","معيار ثانوي: انصباب جنبي","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["cv","معيار ثانوي: انخفاض السعة الحيوية بمقدار ١/٣ من القيمة القصوى","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["taqui","معيار ثانوي: تسرع القلب (معدل القلب ≥ ١٢٠ bpm)","chk",{"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}]],"formula":"<p>تشخيص قصور القلب بوجود <strong>2 من المعايير الكبرى</strong> أو <strong>1 كبرى + 2 صغرى</strong>.</p><p>تُحسب الصغرى فقط إن لم تُعزَ إلى حالة أخرى، مثل ارتفاع الضغط الرئوي أو COPD أو التشمّع أو الاستسقاء أو المتلازمة النفروزية. نقص الوزن بالعلاج قد يكون كبرى أو صغرى؛ ويُحسب هنا كبرى.</p>","sources":[["McKee PA et al. The natural history of congestive heart failure: the Framingham study. N Engl J Med, 1971.","https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJM197112232852601"],["McDonagh TA et al. 2021 ESC Guidelines for the diagnosis and treatment of acute and chronic heart failure. Eur Heart J, 2021.","https://doi.org/10.1093/eurheartj/ehab368"],["Framingham official event protocol,Version2,2006-08-24","https://biolincc.nhlbi.nih.gov/media/studies/framcohort/Protocols/Criteria%20for%20Events%20-%20Sequence%20of%20Events%20File%20SOE.pdf"],["ARIC heart-failure abstraction protocol","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/document.cgi?phd=4516&study_id=phs000280.v3.p1"]],"methodVersion":"فرامنغهام/ماكي 1971: 2 كبرى أو 1 كبرى+2 صغرى؛ نقص الوزن محسوب كبرى","methodVersionLocale":"ar","limits":"يجب أن تكون المعايير الكبرى والصغرى موجودة في الوقت نفسه؛ ويجب مراعاة الأسباب البديلة للعلامات. تستخدم هذه الواجهة فقدان ٤٫٥ kg على الأقل خلال 5 أيام أثناء العلاج كمعيار كبير؛ لا تمنح فقدان الوزن خارج هذا السياق هذه الدرجة. لا تثبت المجموعة التاريخية جميع الأنماط الحالية لقصور القلب ولا تحل محل التقييم البنيوي والوظيفي. يحتوي بروتوكول Framingham لعام 2006 على بنود إضافية، ولا ينبغي عرضه كما لو كانت جميعها منفّذة في هذه النسخة التاريخية.","limitsLocale":"ar","resultLabels":{"Critérios de Framingham":"معايير Framingham","Critérios de Framingham para insuficiência cardíaca":"معايير Framingham لفشل القلب"},"resultUnits":{"maiores + menores":"معايير كبرى + معايير صغرى"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"اختر","yes":"نعم","no":"لا","optional":"اختياري","numeric":"قيمة رقمية","range":"النطاق","calculate":"احسب","calculating":"جارٍ الحساب…","clear":"مسح","heading":"حساب بشفافية","intro":"تحقق من الفئة السكانية والوحدات والإصدار. تعرض النتيجة المعادلة أو التصنيف دون اتخاذ قرار علاجي تلقائي.","restricted":"السجل متاح للاطلاع","restrictedNote":"الحساب معلّق في هذا الإصدار. يظل السجل والمراجعة المعلّقة والمصادر متاحة للعامة.","resultNote":"نتيجة المعادلة أو التصنيف. يعتمد التفسير والتصرف ومدى الانطباق على التقييم المهني والمصدر المحدد.","invalid":"تعذر الحساب بهذه القيم. تحقق من شروط الاستخدام.","unavailable":"خدمة الحساب غير متاحة. حاول مرة أخرى.","connection":"تعذر الاتصال بخدمة الحساب. تحقق من الاتصال وحاول مرة أخرى.","check":"تحقق من القيم المدخلة.","fleischner":"قبل الحساب: مرجع للعقيدات الرئوية المكتشفة عرضًا. لا تنطبق التوصيات على من هم دون 35 عامًا، أو فحص سرطان الرئة، أو كبت المناعة، أو وجود سرطان أولي معروف.","incompleteAssessment":"لا يمكن حساب المجموع دون تقييم مكتمل."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · شيفرة التكامل","clinical":"لم تُجرَ مراجعة سريرية مستقلة.","conditions":"الشروط والمصادر والأذونات","record":"السجل والمراجع","code":"شيفرة JavaScript","cases":"حالات مرجعية","language":"اللغة","formula":"المعادلة الموثقة","edition":"إصدار الطريقة","limits":"الحدود والفئة السكانية","references":"المراجع"}},"zh":{"tool":{"id":"criterios-de-framingham-ic","title":"Framingham 心力衰竭标准","titleLocale":"zh","summary":"按大、小标准进行心力衰竭临床诊断","lead":"Framingham研究的经典临床标准，用于床旁诊断充血性心力衰竭。","fields":[["dpn","主要标准：阵发性夜间呼吸困难或端坐呼吸","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["turgencia","主要标准：颈静脉怒张","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["estertores","主要标准：肺部啰音","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["cardiomegalia","主要标准：X 线显示心脏扩大","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["eap","主要标准：急性肺水肿","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["b3","主要标准：第三心音（奔马律）","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["pvc","主要标准：中心静脉压 > 16 cmH₂O","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["tc","主要标准：循环时间 ≥ 25 s","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["refluxo","主要标准：肝颈静脉回流征","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["perda","主要或次要标准：治疗后 5 天内体重下降 ≥ 4.5 kg","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["edema","次要标准：双侧踝部水肿","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["tosse","次要标准：夜间咳嗽","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["dispneia","次要标准：常规活动时呼吸困难","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["hepatomegalia","次要标准：肝肿大","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["derrame","次要标准：胸腔积液","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["cv","次要标准：肺活量较最大值下降 1/3","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["taqui","次要标准：心动过速（心率 ≥ 120 bpm）","chk",{"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}]],"formula":"<p>心力衰竭诊断需 <strong>2项大标准</strong>或<strong>1项大标准+2项小标准</strong>.</p><p>小标准仅在不能归因于其他病况（如肺动脉高压、COPD、肝硬化、腹水或肾病综合征）时计入。治疗后体重下降可作大或小标准，本处按大标准计。</p>","sources":[["McKee PA et al. The natural history of congestive heart failure: the Framingham study. N Engl J Med, 1971.","https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJM197112232852601"],["McDonagh TA et al. 2021 ESC Guidelines for the diagnosis and treatment of acute and chronic heart failure. Eur Heart J, 2021.","https://doi.org/10.1093/eurheartj/ehab368"],["Framingham official event protocol,Version2,2006-08-24","https://biolincc.nhlbi.nih.gov/media/studies/framcohort/Protocols/Criteria%20for%20Events%20-%20Sequence%20of%20Events%20File%20SOE.pdf"],["ARIC heart-failure abstraction protocol","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/document.cgi?phd=4516&study_id=phs000280.v3.p1"]],"methodVersion":"Framingham/McKee 1971：2大或1大+2小；体重下降按大标准计","methodVersionLocale":"zh","limits":"主要和次要标准必须同时存在，并须考虑这些体征的其他原因。此界面将治疗期间5天内至少减轻4.5 kg作为主要标准；不应将此权重用于缺乏该背景的体重下降。这组历史标准不能确定现代心力衰竭的所有表型，也不能代替结构和功能评估。2006年Framingham方案包含额外项目，不能声称这些项目均已在本历史版本中实现。","limitsLocale":"zh","resultLabels":{"Critérios de Framingham":"Framingham 标准","Critérios de Framingham para insuficiência cardíaca":"Framingham 心力衰竭标准"},"resultUnits":{"maiores + menores":"主要标准 + 次要标准"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"请选择","yes":"是","no":"否","optional":"选填","numeric":"数值","range":"范围","calculate":"计算","calculating":"计算中…","clear":"清除","heading":"透明计算","intro":"请核对适用人群、单位和版本。结果展示公式或分类，不自动作出治疗决定。","restricted":"可查阅工具记录","restrictedNote":"本版本暂停计算。清单、待审事项和来源仍公开。","resultNote":"公式或分类结果。解释、处理及适用性须结合专业评估和所选来源。","invalid":"无法使用这些数值计算。请核对使用条件。","unavailable":"计算服务暂不可用。请重试。","connection":"无法连接计算服务。请检查网络后重试。","check":"请检查输入值。","fleischner":"计算前：此参考适用于偶然发现的肺结节。建议不适用于35岁以下人群、肺癌筛查、免疫抑制或已知原发性癌症患者。","incompleteAssessment":"未完成评估，无法计算总分。"},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · 集成代码","clinical":"尚未开展独立临床审查。","conditions":"条件、来源与许可","record":"记录与参考文献","code":"JavaScript代码","cases":"参考案例","language":"语言","formula":"已记录的公式","edition":"方法版本","limits":"限制与适用人群","references":"参考文献"}},"ja":{"tool":{"id":"criterios-de-framingham-ic","title":"心不全のFramingham基準","titleLocale":"ja","summary":"大・小基準による心不全の臨床診断","lead":"うっ血性心不全をベッドサイドで診断する、Framingham研究の古典的臨床基準です。","fields":[["dpn","大基準：発作性夜間呼吸困難または起坐呼吸","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["turgencia","大基準：頸静脈怒張","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["estertores","大基準：肺ラ音","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["cardiomegalia","大基準：X線で心拡大","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["eap","大基準：急性肺水腫","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["b3","大基準：第3心音（ギャロップ）","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["pvc","大基準：中心静脈圧 > 16 cmH₂O","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["tc","大基準：循環時間 ≥ 25 s","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["refluxo","大基準：肝頸静脈逆流","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["perda","大基準または小基準：治療により5日で ≥ 4.5 kgの体重減少","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["edema","小基準：両側足関節浮腫","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["tosse","小基準：夜間の咳","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["dispneia","小基準：通常の労作で呼吸困難","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["hepatomegalia","小基準：肝腫大","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["derrame","小基準：胸水","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["cv","小基準：肺活量が最大値から1/3減少","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["taqui","小基準：頻脈（心拍数 ≥ 120 bpm）","chk",{"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}]],"formula":"<p>心不全診断： <strong>大基準2項目</strong>または<strong>大基準1+小基準2</strong>.</p><p>小基準は他の病態（肺高血圧、COPD、肝硬変、腹水、ネフローゼ症候群など）で説明できない場合のみ加算します。治療による体重減少は大・小基準になり得ますが、ここでは大基準です。</p>","sources":[["McKee PA et al. The natural history of congestive heart failure: the Framingham study. N Engl J Med, 1971.","https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJM197112232852601"],["McDonagh TA et al. 2021 ESC Guidelines for the diagnosis and treatment of acute and chronic heart failure. Eur Heart J, 2021.","https://doi.org/10.1093/eurheartj/ehab368"],["Framingham official event protocol,Version2,2006-08-24","https://biolincc.nhlbi.nih.gov/media/studies/framcohort/Protocols/Criteria%20for%20Events%20-%20Sequence%20of%20Events%20File%20SOE.pdf"],["ARIC heart-failure abstraction protocol","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/document.cgi?phd=4516&study_id=phs000280.v3.p1"]],"methodVersion":"Framingham/McKee 1971：大2または大1+小2；体重減少は大基準","methodVersionLocale":"ja","limits":"大基準と小基準は同時に存在する必要があり、徴候の別の原因も考慮してください。この画面では、治療中の5日間で4.5 kg以上の体重減少を大基準として扱います。この状況以外の体重減少に同じ重みを適用しないでください。歴史的基準だけで現在の心不全のすべての表現型を確定することはできず、構造・機能評価の代わりにはなりません。2006年Framinghamプロトコルには追加項目があり、それらすべてがこの歴史的版に実装されているかのように示してはいけません。","limitsLocale":"ja","resultLabels":{"Critérios de Framingham":"Framingham基準","Critérios de Framingham para insuficiência cardíaca":"心不全のFramingham基準"},"resultUnits":{"maiores + menores":"大基準 + 小基準"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"選択","yes":"はい","no":"いいえ","optional":"任意","numeric":"数値","range":"範囲","calculate":"計算","calculating":"計算中…","clear":"クリア","heading":"根拠を明示して計算","intro":"対象集団、単位、版を確認してください。結果は式または分類を示すもので、治療方針を自動決定しません。","restricted":"記録を参照できます","restrictedNote":"この版では計算を停止しています。目録、未完了の審査、出典は公開されています。","resultNote":"式または分類の結果です。解釈、対応、適用可能性は専門家による評価と選択した出典に依存します。","invalid":"この値では計算できません。使用条件を確認してください。","unavailable":"計算サービスを利用できません。再試行してください。","connection":"計算サービスに接続できません。接続を確認して再試行してください。","check":"入力値を確認してください。","fleischner":"計算前：偶発的に発見された肺結節に関する参考です。35歳未満、肺がん検診、免疫抑制、既知の原発がんには推奨を適用できません。","incompleteAssessment":"評価が完了していないため合計を計算できません。"},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · 連携コード","clinical":"独立した臨床レビューは実施されていません。","conditions":"条件・出典・許諾","record":"記録・参考文献","code":"JavaScriptコード","cases":"参照ケース","language":"言語","formula":"記載された計算式","edition":"方法の版","limits":"限界・対象集団","references":"参考文献"}},"hi":{"tool":{"id":"criterios-de-framingham-ic","title":"हृदय विफलता के Framingham मानदंड","titleLocale":"hi","summary":"प्रमुख और गौण मानदंडों से हृदय विफलता का नैदानिक निदान","lead":"रोगी के शय्या-पास कंजेस्टिव हृदय विफलता निदान हेतु Framingham अध्ययन के पारंपरिक नैदानिक मानदंड।","fields":[["dpn","प्रमुख मानदंड: पैरॉक्सिस्मल नॉक्टर्नल डिस्प्निया या ऑर्थोप्निया","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["turgencia","प्रमुख मानदंड: जुगुलर शिरा का फैलाव","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["estertores","प्रमुख मानदंड: फेफड़ों में क्रैकल्स","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["cardiomegalia","प्रमुख मानदंड: एक्स-रे पर कार्डियोमेगाली","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["eap","प्रमुख मानदंड: तीव्र पल्मोनरी एडिमा","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["b3","प्रमुख मानदंड: तीसरी हृदय ध्वनि (गैलप)","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["pvc","प्रमुख मानदंड: केंद्रीय शिरापरक दाब > 16 cmH₂O","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["tc","प्रमुख मानदंड: परिसंचरण समय ≥ 25 s","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["refluxo","प्रमुख मानदंड: हेपैटोजुगुलर रिफ़्लक्स","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["perda","प्रमुख या गौण मानदंड: उपचार से 5 दिनों में ≥ 4.5 kg वज़न घटना","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["edema","गौण मानदंड: दोनों टखनों में एडिमा","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["tosse","गौण मानदंड: रात में खाँसी","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["dispneia","गौण मानदंड: सामान्य परिश्रम पर साँस फूलना","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["hepatomegalia","गौण मानदंड: हेपैटोमेगाली","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["derrame","गौण मानदंड: प्ल्यूरल इफ़्यूज़न","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["cv","गौण मानदंड: अधिकतम की तुलना में वाइटल कैपेसिटी में 1/3 की कमी","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["taqui","गौण मानदंड: टैकीकार्डिया (हृदय गति ≥ 120 bpm)","chk",{"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}]],"formula":"<p>हृदय विफलता का निदान इनसे: <strong>2 प्रमुख मानदंड</strong> या <strong>1 प्रमुख + 2 गौण</strong>.</p><p>गौण मानदंड तभी गिने जाते हैं जब अन्य कारण (फुफ्फुसीय उच्च रक्तचाप, COPD, सिरोसिस, जलोदर या नेफ्रोटिक सिंड्रोम) न समझाएँ। उपचार से वजन घटना प्रमुख या गौण हो सकता है; यहाँ प्रमुख है।</p>","sources":[["McKee PA et al. The natural history of congestive heart failure: the Framingham study. N Engl J Med, 1971.","https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJM197112232852601"],["McDonagh TA et al. 2021 ESC Guidelines for the diagnosis and treatment of acute and chronic heart failure. Eur Heart J, 2021.","https://doi.org/10.1093/eurheartj/ehab368"],["Framingham official event protocol,Version2,2006-08-24","https://biolincc.nhlbi.nih.gov/media/studies/framcohort/Protocols/Criteria%20for%20Events%20-%20Sequence%20of%20Events%20File%20SOE.pdf"],["ARIC heart-failure abstraction protocol","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/document.cgi?phd=4516&study_id=phs000280.v3.p1"]],"methodVersion":"Framingham/McKee 1971: 2 प्रमुख या 1 प्रमुख+2 गौण; वजन घटना प्रमुख गिना गया","methodVersionLocale":"hi","limits":"प्रमुख और गौण मानदंड एक ही समय पर मौजूद होने चाहिए; संकेतों के वैकल्पिक कारण भी ध्यान में रखें। यह इंटरफ़ेस उपचार के दौरान 5 दिनों में कम से कम 4.5 kg वजन घटने को प्रमुख मानदंड मानता है; इस संदर्भ के बिना वजन घटने को यही भार न दें। ऐतिहासिक मानदंड आज के हृदय-विफलता के सभी प्रकार स्थापित नहीं करते और संरचनात्मक तथा कार्यात्मक मूल्यांकन का विकल्प नहीं हैं। Framingham 2006 प्रोटोकॉल में अतिरिक्त मदें हैं; उन्हें इस ऐतिहासिक संस्करण में पूरी तरह लागू बताया नहीं जाना चाहिए।","limitsLocale":"hi","resultLabels":{"Critérios de Framingham":"Framingham मानदंड","Critérios de Framingham para insuficiência cardíaca":"हृदय विफलता के Framingham मानदंड"},"resultUnits":{"maiores + menores":"प्रमुख + लघु मानदंड"},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"चुनें","yes":"हाँ","no":"नहीं","optional":"वैकल्पिक","numeric":"संख्यात्मक मान","range":"सीमा","calculate":"गणना करें","calculating":"गणना जारी है…","clear":"साफ़ करें","heading":"पारदर्शिता के साथ गणना","intro":"जनसमूह, इकाइयाँ और संस्करण जाँचें। परिणाम सूत्र या वर्गीकरण दिखाता है; यह स्वतः उपचार संबंधी निर्णय नहीं देता।","restricted":"रिकॉर्ड देखने के लिए उपलब्ध है","restrictedNote":"इस संस्करण में गणना रुकी हुई है। सूची, लंबित समीक्षा और स्रोत सार्वजनिक हैं।","resultNote":"सूत्र या वर्गीकरण का परिणाम। व्याख्या, कार्यवाही और उपयुक्तता पेशेवर मूल्यांकन और चुने गए स्रोत पर निर्भर है।","invalid":"इन मानों से गणना नहीं हो सकी। उपयोग की शर्तें जाँचें।","unavailable":"गणना सेवा उपलब्ध नहीं है। फिर प्रयास करें।","connection":"गणना सेवा से संपर्क नहीं हो सका। कनेक्शन जाँचकर फिर प्रयास करें।","check":"दर्ज मान जाँचें।","fleischner":"गणना से पहले: आकस्मिक रूप से पाए गए फेफड़ों के नोड्यूल के लिए संदर्भ। सिफ़ारिशें 35 वर्ष से कम आयु, फेफड़ों के कैंसर की स्क्रीनिंग, प्रतिरक्षा दमन या ज्ञात प्राथमिक कैंसर पर लागू नहीं होतीं।","incompleteAssessment":"पूर्ण मूल्यांकन के बिना कुल स्कोर नहीं निकाला जा सकता।"},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · एकीकरण कोड","clinical":"स्वतंत्र नैदानिक समीक्षा नहीं की गई है।","conditions":"शर्तें, स्रोत और अनुमतियाँ","record":"रिकॉर्ड और संदर्भ","code":"JavaScript कोड","cases":"संदर्भ मामले","language":"भाषा","formula":"दस्तावेज़ित सूत्र","edition":"विधि का संस्करण","limits":"सीमाएँ और जनसमूह","references":"संदर्भ"}}}};
